#: ../../../cards.md:334
msgid ""
"Flag. When set, the card link opens in a new browser tab "
"(`target=\"_blank\"`, `rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"`). Works with all `link-"
"type` values; has no effect without `link`. Sphinx renders the `rel` "
"attribute only from version 7.4; browsers already treat `target=\"_blank\"` "
"links as `noopener`. It affects only HTML-based output (HTML, EPUB); other "
"formats ignore it. Tell readers the link opens a new tab, for example in "
"`link-alt`. To open every external link in a new tab, site-wide, see the "
"[sphinx-new-tab-link](https://pypi.org/project/sphinx-new-tab-link/) "
